WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:12.703
Candy is staring at Terry's poster.

00:00:12.947 --> 00:00:15.916
The play's premiere will be in ten days.

00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:21.150
Candy’s heart has already
flew to Broadway.

00:00:25.192 --> 00:00:31.495
A fellow traveller

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.207
Who is it?

00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:49.375
I am Candy.

00:00:49.525 --> 00:00:50.712
Come in.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.516
Sorry for disturbing,

00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:56.215
I...

00:00:56.365 --> 00:00:59.885
I was looking
at your application for leave.

00:01:00.261 --> 00:01:02.058
Dr. Leonard...

00:01:02.696 --> 00:01:06.894
Don't you think five days leave
is kind of long, Candy?

00:01:07.134 --> 00:01:10.930
But I really need to go to New York.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.934
To New York?
Are you going to Broadway?

00:01:15.084 --> 00:01:16.408
No...

00:01:17.244 --> 00:01:21.613
I don't want to ask for the reasons.

00:01:21.782 --> 00:01:24.133
Is it approved?

00:01:24.618 --> 00:01:28.645
Your ten days of leave
start from tomorrow.

00:01:28.889 --> 00:01:30.281
No, I...

00:01:30.431 --> 00:01:33.587
You must go to Florida
before you have your leave.

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:37.263
To Florida? But it's so far...

00:01:37.698 --> 00:01:42.567
You need to deliver a document
for the Principal Kreis.

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:44.863
Principal?

00:01:45.013 --> 00:01:48.736
Yes, you have plenty of time for this.

00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:50.434
Understood.

00:02:01.622 --> 00:02:02.987
Florida?

00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:05.584
Sounds good, Candy.

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.723
But, Mr. Albert...

00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:12.257
Don't worry about me, I am good.

00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:15.332
I will ask Patty and Annie
to look after you.

00:02:15.536 --> 00:02:18.164
I am all good now.

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.999
I just can't remember the past.

00:02:21.875 --> 00:02:24.837
I will be back real soon.

00:02:25.087 --> 00:02:28.443
Don't miss the show in Broadway!

00:02:31.585 --> 00:02:34.445
Mr. Albert, you laugh of me!

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.015
Oh yeah, Candy.

00:02:36.165 --> 00:02:38.183
Do you want to take this poster
with you to Florida?

00:02:38.659 --> 00:02:39.751
I don't know!

00:02:53.374 --> 00:02:54.773
Miss...

00:02:55.376 --> 00:02:57.870
Are you on this train?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.998
Yes.

00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:03.444
May I ask where are you getting off ?

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.641
At the last stop.

00:03:07.154 --> 00:03:09.213
Great!

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:12.723
Gill, come here, what are you doing?

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.024
Gill, come quick!

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.393
Faster!

00:03:21.543 --> 00:03:24.429
Miss,
this kid is going to Florida as well.

00:03:24.579 --> 00:03:28.565
Please take care of him.

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:32.801
Leave me alone, I am not a child!

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:36.637
Are you sure?
You bought a child fare.

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.708
Please.

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.584
Ok.

00:03:43.089 --> 00:03:46.551
At least you could have picked me
a beautiful girl.

00:03:46.701 --> 00:03:48.316
What did you say?!

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.954
You want some chocolate?

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:09.645
Don't treat me like a child, it's rude.

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:12.644
You...

00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:15.745
Oh yeah, I haven't introduced myself.

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:18.680
I am Candy.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.885
Nice meeting you, Gill.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.698
Gilbert!

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:29.828
I am sorry, that ma'am called you Gill.

00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:31.837
You can just call me Gill.

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:34.873
You are cute.

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.215
Stear!

00:04:54.393 --> 00:04:55.792
Patty!

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:57.421
Annie told me that...

00:04:57.571 --> 00:04:59.923
...Candy went to Florida. Is it true?

00:05:00.073 --> 00:05:01.897
With this morning's train.

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:04.895
What? How can she do that!

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:07.397
She left without saying anything!

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.495
It was job related,
she didn't want us to worry.

00:05:10.785 --> 00:05:12.905
I was going to give her a gift.

00:05:13.779 --> 00:05:15.306
What is that?

00:05:15.456 --> 00:05:16.939
A specially made swimming tube.

00:05:18.651 --> 00:05:20.791
In such cold weather?

00:05:20.941 --> 00:05:23.718
It's warm in Florida.

00:05:23.956 --> 00:05:26.288
America is so big!

00:05:26.759 --> 00:05:30.354
I forgot this is your first time
to going overseas.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.524
But I heard about hurricanes.

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:40.035
They occur often in Florida
in between summer and autumn.

00:05:40.606 --> 00:05:42.870
What a smart student from London!

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:02.285
Where are we?

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:04.852
Don't open it.

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:07.231
You are up, Gill.

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:10.401
I don't want to look out the window.

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:15.904
I will think of my father who died.

00:06:16.108 --> 00:06:17.768
Your father?

00:06:17.918 --> 00:06:20.068
A lousy doctor killed him.

00:06:22.881 --> 00:06:25.281
Don't say that.

00:06:25.617 --> 00:06:26.606
But...

00:06:27.186 --> 00:06:28.946
I am a nurse.

00:06:29.096 --> 00:06:30.579
A nurse?

00:06:30.789 --> 00:06:33.690
You are not
from St. Joanna Hospital, are you?

00:06:33.892 --> 00:06:35.223
I am.

00:06:35.694 --> 00:06:39.957
A lousy doctor from that hospital
killed my father.

00:06:40.107 --> 00:06:43.399
Nonsense! There is
no lousy doctor in our hospital!

00:06:46.071 --> 00:06:49.006
I apologize.

00:06:50.876 --> 00:06:54.539
Gill, who exactly is the lousy doctor
you were talking about?

00:06:55.447 --> 00:06:57.176
The vice principal.

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:05.444
Murderer, give me back my father!

00:07:05.694 --> 00:07:07.551
I told you,

00:07:07.701 --> 00:07:09.634
your father was very sick.

00:07:09.884 --> 00:07:12.889
Don't give me that,
he came here one year ago!

00:07:13.039 --> 00:07:16.393
You said he had an upset stomach!

00:07:16.543 --> 00:07:19.229
We confirmed that it was cancer.

00:07:19.379 --> 00:07:22.132
It's a miracle
that he lived for one year.

00:07:22.282 --> 00:07:23.800
You are lying!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.402
If you have operated on him,
he wouldn't have died!

00:07:28.346 --> 00:07:31.144
I have other things to deal with.
Somebody!

00:07:33.218 --> 00:07:35.448
Take him out.

00:07:37.222 --> 00:07:38.746
What are you doing? Stop!

00:07:39.224 --> 00:07:41.818
Lousy doctor!

00:07:46.831 --> 00:07:48.825
I understand your feelings.

00:07:48.975 --> 00:07:50.827
But Dr. Leonard is a good doctor.

00:07:50.977 --> 00:07:52.062
I don't care.

00:07:52.212 --> 00:07:53.229
Because of his misjudgement,

00:07:53.379 --> 00:07:55.363
I needed to beg my relatives
in Florida to take me in.

00:07:55.907 --> 00:07:58.205
That's why you're on this train.

00:07:58.643 --> 00:08:00.968
You must be going on vacation.

00:08:01.513 --> 00:08:03.276
I am on a business trip.

00:08:03.682 --> 00:08:07.043
I need to deliver some
important documents to the principal.

00:08:07.193 --> 00:08:08.745
Important documents?

00:08:29.474 --> 00:08:32.238
He is not here,
maybe he went to the toilet?

00:08:33.845 --> 00:08:35.305
It's gone!

00:08:35.455 --> 00:08:37.974
The suitcase with the documents!

00:08:38.516 --> 00:08:39.847
Gill!

00:08:51.329 --> 00:08:52.855
I can't find him.

00:08:53.005 --> 00:08:56.097
Did he get off the train
while I was sleeping?

00:09:04.709 --> 00:09:05.971
Gill!

00:09:07.411 --> 00:09:09.203
Here you are!

00:09:09.353 --> 00:09:11.507
Stop playing around!

00:09:11.657 --> 00:09:14.551
Let me tell you,
there is nothing in the suitcase.

00:09:15.119 --> 00:09:16.552
Gill...

00:09:18.522 --> 00:09:20.717
Where are the documents?

00:09:21.092 --> 00:09:22.491
Tell me, Gill!

00:09:23.127 --> 00:09:26.189
You think your father will be happy
if you do this?

00:09:26.539 --> 00:09:30.727
Of course, I have avenged him!

00:09:31.177 --> 00:09:34.299
I am the one who will suffer
if the documents are gone.

00:09:34.505 --> 00:09:36.132
Dr Leonard should be
the one suffering!

00:09:36.282 --> 00:09:38.573
He is responsible for the documents.

00:09:38.809 --> 00:09:40.201
Have you read the documents?

00:09:41.812 --> 00:09:44.246
I hate doctors and nurses.

00:09:44.415 --> 00:09:47.116
You won't understand my feelings.

00:09:49.253 --> 00:09:50.914
Maybe.

00:09:52.089 --> 00:09:55.748
I don't have parents.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.793
Are they dead?

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.098
I was abandoned by my parents.

00:10:03.667 --> 00:10:06.495
Gill, where are the documents?

00:10:06.645 --> 00:10:08.197
I threw them away, from here.

00:10:08.939 --> 00:10:11.806
- When?
- When we were crossing the bridge.

00:10:12.343 --> 00:10:13.435
Move!

00:10:14.445 --> 00:10:15.874
What are you doing?

00:10:16.046 --> 00:10:18.276
I will jump off the train
to look for the documents.

00:10:18.682 --> 00:10:20.009
Are you serious, Candy?

00:10:20.159 --> 00:10:22.609
I won't get hurt at this speed.

00:10:24.988 --> 00:10:26.349
Stop, Candy!

00:10:27.424 --> 00:10:29.051
- Watch out!
- Let go of me!

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.720
I am used to it!

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:33.490
No, it's too dangerous!

00:10:34.898 --> 00:10:36.091
What are you two doing here?

00:10:36.241 --> 00:10:38.532
She was trying to jump off the train.

00:10:39.036 --> 00:10:40.435
Stop being silly!

00:10:40.704 --> 00:10:43.809
Someone is sick,
I really need a doctor.

00:10:44.009 --> 00:10:45.902
- Someone is sick?
- Yes.

00:10:46.176 --> 00:10:48.370
There is an ill child in car number two.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:52.438
Take me there, I am a nurse.

00:11:18.742 --> 00:11:21.236
Looks like appendicitis.

00:11:21.386 --> 00:11:22.737
Appendicitis?

00:11:22.887 --> 00:11:24.973
Will she be alright, nurse?

00:11:25.282 --> 00:11:28.043
When did the pain start?

00:11:28.193 --> 00:11:30.446
Before boarding.

00:11:30.596 --> 00:11:32.948
How could you let her
board the train like this?

00:11:33.098 --> 00:11:38.620
She always lies
about being uncomfortable.

00:11:39.062 --> 00:11:41.428
How far is the next stop?

00:11:42.933 --> 00:11:46.027
One hour to go.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.868
I hope it doesn't get worse.

00:11:49.239 --> 00:11:52.174
Gill, get me some ice water.

00:11:55.212 --> 00:11:58.803
Is there any doctor on this train?
Go ask around.

00:11:58.953 --> 00:12:00.280
Ok.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.097
Sorry for disturbing!

00:12:18.368 --> 00:12:20.529
We have a patient on the train.

00:12:20.679 --> 00:12:23.164
Is there any doctor on this train?

00:12:27.411 --> 00:12:28.776
Hang on.

00:12:31.481 --> 00:12:33.244
You'll be fine.

00:12:34.484 --> 00:12:35.576
Are there any doctors?

00:12:36.152 --> 00:12:38.313
Not even one.

00:12:39.389 --> 00:12:43.120
Why didn't I trust her?

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.284
Calm down.

00:12:45.795 --> 00:12:48.389
Calm down? I can't calm down!

00:12:48.539 --> 00:12:52.833
My daughter could die any second,
how am I going to calm down?!

00:12:53.303 --> 00:12:54.628
Mom...

00:12:54.778 --> 00:12:56.261
Carrie!

00:12:57.807 --> 00:13:00.207
Can you speed up?

00:13:01.044 --> 00:13:03.842
It's the fastest we can go.

00:13:16.793 --> 00:13:19.023
Nurse, Carrie...

00:13:19.762 --> 00:13:21.787
Carrie is not going to die, right?

00:13:25.602 --> 00:13:27.570
Five minutes to the station!

00:13:28.538 --> 00:13:30.802
Have a stretcher ready!

00:13:48.358 --> 00:13:50.189
Don't move the patient.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:52.220
Why?

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:56.755
The station manager told me that
the doctor won't be back until late.

00:13:57.667 --> 00:13:59.060
What should we do?!

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.603
How much further to the next station?

00:14:03.539 --> 00:14:05.667
About three hours.

00:14:05.817 --> 00:14:07.073
Three hours?

00:14:07.343 --> 00:14:10.039
We can't afford
another three hours, nurse.

00:14:11.113 --> 00:14:13.140
We have no choice.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.548
The best we can do
is to go to the next station.

00:14:16.752 --> 00:14:18.913
Mr. Conductor, let's move.

00:14:19.063 --> 00:14:21.218
We cannot leave now.

00:14:21.657 --> 00:14:24.952
Why? My daughter is dying.

00:14:25.302 --> 00:14:28.219
If we go now, we will
collide with the oncoming train.

00:14:29.031 --> 00:14:31.891
We need to wait for the oncoming train
to leave for Chicago first.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.039
It's late.

00:14:48.084 --> 00:14:49.142
It's coming!

00:14:49.785 --> 00:14:51.912
The train to Chicago is coming!

00:14:57.126 --> 00:14:59.822
Candy, we are leaving!

00:15:00.029 --> 00:15:02.896
Gill, let's go look for doctors.

00:15:03.265 --> 00:15:04.525
Doctors?

00:15:04.675 --> 00:15:08.001
There must be a lot of passengers
on the train right across.

00:15:08.371 --> 00:15:09.702
Maybe...

00:15:10.539 --> 00:15:11.801
You are right.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:27.948
There are any doctors on this train?

00:15:28.657 --> 00:15:31.919
We got a patient,
is there any doctor here?

00:15:32.069 --> 00:15:35.395
There are any doctors here?

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.592
You...

00:15:38.868 --> 00:15:41.128
You are a doctor?
We have an emergency here.

00:15:41.278 --> 00:15:42.898
I'm coming!

00:15:48.911 --> 00:15:51.402
She needs surgery right away.

00:15:51.814 --> 00:15:54.119
Please, doctor!

00:15:54.469 --> 00:15:57.112
But on the train...

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.644
There is a clinic in the town.

00:16:01.094 --> 00:16:02.489
I will be your assistant.

00:16:02.691 --> 00:16:04.118
You?

00:16:04.268 --> 00:16:06.855
I am a surgical nurse.

00:16:07.329 --> 00:16:09.923
You are? Then get ready!

00:16:21.944 --> 00:16:23.237
Clamp.

00:16:23.387 --> 00:16:24.643
Yes.

00:16:37.092 --> 00:16:38.319
Carrie.

00:16:38.469 --> 00:16:42.694
We wouldn't be able to save her
had it been another thirty minutes.

00:16:43.465 --> 00:16:46.662
Is Carrie alright now?

00:16:47.136 --> 00:16:49.863
She is still anaesthetised.

00:16:50.013 --> 00:16:51.665
Thank you so much!

00:16:51.815 --> 00:16:54.068
The doctor here
will take care of the rest.

00:16:54.218 --> 00:16:56.337
I will leave him directions.

00:16:56.487 --> 00:16:57.777
I...

00:16:58.013 --> 00:16:59.844
I am in a hurry.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.545
You did a good job,
which hospital are you from?

00:17:05.788 --> 00:17:08.315
Chicago, St. Joanna.

00:17:08.465 --> 00:17:12.224
I see.
Please say hi to Dr. Leonard for me.

00:17:13.228 --> 00:17:15.456
You know our vice principal?

00:17:15.606 --> 00:17:18.591
Tell him I am his rival
from his school years.

00:17:19.535 --> 00:17:21.799
Doctor, may I have your name?

00:17:22.104 --> 00:17:24.197
That's fine,
the train is waiting for me.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.139
Doctor...

00:17:29.978 --> 00:17:31.946
Is Gill waiting for me?

00:17:33.014 --> 00:17:34.481
The train is leaving.

00:17:35.917 --> 00:17:38.145
Until the town doctor comes back,

00:17:38.295 --> 00:17:40.381
I need to stay and look after Carrie.

00:17:40.589 --> 00:17:43.383
Thank you.

00:17:43.533 --> 00:17:46.154
But the next train is tomorrow!

00:17:46.695 --> 00:17:49.122
I will go check us in.

00:17:49.272 --> 00:17:52.092
Gill, can you bring my luggage?

00:17:52.242 --> 00:17:53.498
Ok.

00:18:05.514 --> 00:18:07.914
Is the doctor back yet?

00:18:08.316 --> 00:18:10.181
No, but there's nothing to worry about.

00:18:11.153 --> 00:18:15.215
I wonder if they have horses
for rent here?

00:18:15.665 --> 00:18:17.517
Why do you need a horse?

00:18:17.667 --> 00:18:20.459
I want to go look for the documents
you threw away.

00:18:21.262 --> 00:18:22.559
Candy...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.100
This...
You didn't throw it away?

00:18:32.474 --> 00:18:35.272
Sorry, I hid it.

00:18:36.344 --> 00:18:38.107
Thank goodness!

00:18:40.715 --> 00:18:42.444
Are you alright, Candy?

00:18:43.184 --> 00:18:44.446
What happened?

00:18:44.686 --> 00:18:47.519
I haven't had anything to eat.

00:18:47.722 --> 00:18:49.519
I will go look for food.

00:18:50.258 --> 00:18:53.694
Wait, Gill,
all the restaurants are closed.

00:18:54.529 --> 00:18:58.989
I was wrong about nurses and doctors.

00:19:00.067 --> 00:19:04.167
Candy, you and that doctor
saved Carrie's life.

00:19:04.906 --> 00:19:09.075
Gill, the same is true
for doctor Leonard.

00:19:10.578 --> 00:19:13.239
Even if dad didn't have cancer,

00:19:13.389 --> 00:19:16.075
he was going to die sooner or later.

00:19:16.225 --> 00:19:18.043
Your dad...

00:19:18.193 --> 00:19:21.676
He was the lighting technician
at the Elmore Theatre.

00:19:21.826 --> 00:19:23.654
The Elmore Theatre?

00:19:24.225 --> 00:19:25.618
The last show was...

00:19:25.768 --> 00:19:28.560
Strasford troupe's "King Lear".

00:19:39.240 --> 00:19:42.403
Although I didn't know
much about stage play,

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:47.372
I could see dad was more serious
and determined than usual.

00:19:48.182 --> 00:19:49.376
Dad...

00:19:49.683 --> 00:19:52.777
Dad endured the pain
to finish his last show.

00:19:54.855 --> 00:19:57.346
I saw that play!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:01.521
Really, Candy?

00:20:02.062 --> 00:20:03.055
Yes.

00:20:03.205 --> 00:20:04.790
Dad told me when he got home...

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.260
It's been so long
since he saw such a talented actor.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:11.498
The King of France...

00:20:11.738 --> 00:20:14.798
Terry! Terrius G. Grandchester!

00:20:16.877 --> 00:20:18.337
I guess that's his name.

00:20:18.487 --> 00:20:20.973
Terry is my friend!

00:20:21.123 --> 00:20:22.040
Candy's?

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:25.358
When I return
I will go look for him on Broadway!

00:20:25.508 --> 00:20:26.918
On Broadway!

00:20:27.154 --> 00:20:31.583
Dad always wanted to work
in those theatres in Broadway.

00:20:31.733 --> 00:20:35.058
It's not the theatre that matters,
it's the heart and dedication.

00:20:35.462 --> 00:20:38.192
Elmo Theatre’s lighting technician
is just as respected as the others.

00:20:40.667 --> 00:20:43.465
Dad would be happy if he could hear this.

00:20:49.209 --> 00:20:52.736
This small town is just like a stage.

00:20:53.413 --> 00:20:55.347
The moon is shining
like a theatre projector.

00:20:57.017 --> 00:21:00.885
It must be your dad's masterpiece
from Heaven.

00:21:06.293 --> 00:21:09.751
I will tell Terry about Gill's father.

00:21:12.833 --> 00:21:15.393
In an unknown hotel,

00:21:15.902 --> 00:21:19.599
Candy seems to have Terry
in her sight already.

00:21:21.074 --> 00:21:24.441
Although New York is
miles and miles away,

00:21:24.645 --> 00:21:28.342
Terry is somewhere so near.
